      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have also same latency around 180. This is no problem for most events, but there are some problems:\n- PVP battles, the delay is bit strange\n- Murder games also bit off due delay. You think you're killed but you won actually at end.\n- Also some interactions, where we easy \"miss\" each other like hugging so i need move a bit back to correct it.\n- delay in handwriting / poor handwriting. Delay causes broken lines or missing parts, makes sometimes unreadable.",
      "viewerReactions": null
